## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a full CAPA program around a nuanced data-leak due to a race in schema evolution, ensuring cross-tenant and cross-region considerations are baked in.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model with evidence, tenant/stream IDs, redaction configs, logs, RCA link
- Region-aware lifecycle: detect, contain, remediate, verify, close
- Minimal REST API for CAPA creation/update with linked artifacts
- Cross-tenant/region metrics: recurrence, MTTR, false positives; canary rollout
- RCA template and validation workflow

